;; eve.db.ds carve exceptions — vars kept despite no static caller in
;; src+test, in groups, each with its reason. Carve's bundled
;; clj-kondo (2023.01.20) cannot load this repo's analyze-call hooks
;; (it warns "file hooks/eve_db_ds not found" for defn+/defcomp/
;; cond+/deftrecord/sci-fn/db-fn), so uses inside those macro shapes
;; are invisible to it; the fleet clj-kondo 2026.10.26 with hooks is
;; the analysis of record and reports none of these as unused.
;;
;; 1. Eve deftype-generated vars (suffixed __Flat, __from-header,
;;    -type-id, -type-key, -offset, and the Name? predicate): emitted
;;    by eve.alpha/deftype for every deftype; reached by Eve's type
;;    registry and flat/slab machinery at runtime, never by source
;;    reference. Deleting them is not possible — they are regenerated
;;    by the macro from the deftype forms in bset.cljc, db.cljc and
;;    the deftype laws test.
eve.db.ds.bset/Leaf__from-header
eve.db.ds.bset/Leaf-type-id
eve.db.ds.bset/Leaf-offset
eve.db.ds.bset/Leaf-type-key
eve.db.ds.bset/Leaf?
eve.db.ds.bset/Leaf__Flat
eve.db.ds.bset/Node-offset
eve.db.ds.bset/Node-type-id
eve.db.ds.bset/Node__from-header
eve.db.ds.bset/Node-type-key
eve.db.ds.bset/Node__Flat
eve.db.ds.bset/Node?
eve.db.ds.db/Datom-type-id
eve.db.ds.db/Datom__Flat
eve.db.ds.db/Datom-type-key
eve.db.ds.db/Datom__from-header
eve.db.ds.db/Datom-offset
eve.db.ds.db/DB__from-header
eve.db.ds.db/DB__Flat
eve.db.ds.db/DB-type-key
eve.db.ds.db/DB-type-id
eve.db.ds.db/DB-offset
eve.db.ds.db/FilteredDB__Flat
